<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-tempĕrĭes</span></b> ,
			ēi, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>intemperateness</i>, <i>inclemency.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 8,
					18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquarum,</span>”
				<i>immoderate rains</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					31</span></i>
			.— Hence, transf., <i>a tempest</i>,
				<i>storm</i>, i. e. <i>calamity</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intemperies modo in nostram advenit domum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Capt. 4, 4, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Intemperate behavior</i>, <i>outrageous conduct</i>, <i>fury</i>, <i>madness</i>, <i>insanity</i>, <i>folly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 4, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cohortium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 64</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulierum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 23, 11</span></i>
			: intemperies ista quae <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγχολία</span> dicitur, <i><span class="en">id. 18, 7,
				4</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">has ejus (Xanthippes) intemperies in maritum
					demirari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					1, 17, 2</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			gen., <i>intemperance</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ebrietatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just. 12, 13, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
